  "name": "Zul'Gurub",
  "size": 20
 },
 "notes": "Numbers follow the Renataki section of docs/research/zul-gurub/edge-of-madness.md: 333,100 HP (Era), level 63, 20-man, no adds. No cadences or Enrage threshold are published: the cycle length (Gouge, then Vanish after 45/40/40 s), Thousand Blades interval, and the 25% Enrage are estimates. Boss melee (380 per 2 s) is scaled so a 10,000 HP tank survives normal play and dies if the healer ignores a spike. Vanish is a `submerged` phase with hpFrom = hpTo, and on reappearing he is teleported into the raid with a threat reset, standing in for the Ambush and 2 s stun on a random player. Ambush is a one-tick debuff on a random player (playerChance 0.35, 2,600 hit) because the sim has no burst on reappearance otherwise; the real one can kill cloth outright. Pets following him, AoE and Demoralizing Shout revealing him early are not modelled; he always comes back on a timer. Gouge is an `aoe` with a 4 s stun (DBC) that also catches the tank at 8 yd, which is real. Thousand Blades is an `aoe` on the whole raid (radius 0) for 1,094. Enrage is the engine's `enrage` at 25%; real raids report he also enrages, threshold unknown. Thrash is not modelled.",
